{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/811660-npc-lionela-ballard-the-kind-beast","id":811660,"title":"[NPC] Lionela Ballard, the kind beast","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-01-19T04:07:34-08:00","id":811660,"title":"[NPC] Lionela Ballard, the kind beast","content":"Hello everyone, I do not frequent Changeling forums a lot, and I'm not a big changeling guru, however it so happens that in my vampire game I needed a kind upernatural, and I decided to make it a changeling. Comments and thoughts are more than welcome <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <a href=\"http://cofdarkness.tumblr.com/post/137615899822/lionela-ballard-the-kind-beast\" target=\"_blank\">tumblr post with her and her profile picture</a><br /> <br /> Copy pasted character: <span style=\"color:#444444\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica Neue\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Backstory: Lionela was born in a small town somewhere in Europe, back in 1950s. There she went to study medicine, but was much more interested in parties and courting boys. On one of her nightly walk arounds she was kidnapped and dragged through the Thorns. A lot of time has passed and she escaped, changed forever by what she saw there. To her surprise, what only seemed like a couple of years in captivity, was actually more than 50. She was quickly found by Summer Court so she joined up. A calm and kind girl, learned to utilise anger when she needed it, while it wasn\u2019t the entirety who she was. She didn\u2019t feel at place in the court and she didn\u2019t want to stay where she lived, so she left and started traveling around the world and looking for a new purpose in her life\u2026</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#444444\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica Neue\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Lionela Ballard</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#444444\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica Neue\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Concept: The helpful socialite </span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#444444\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica Neue\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Virtue: Kind </span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#444444\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica Neue\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Vice: Naive</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#444444\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica Neue\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Court: Summer</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#444444\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica Neue\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Seeming: Beast</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#444444\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica Neue\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Kith: The Bright One</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#444444\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica Neue\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Wyrd: 1 </span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#444444\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica Neue\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Clarity: 6 </span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#444444\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica Neue\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Aspirations </span></span></span><ul><li>Find a purpose in life</li> <li>Survive current encounter with the Vampire (Seed)</li> <li>Learn how to hide better (improve stealth)</li> </ul><br /> <span style=\"color:#444444\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica Neue\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Attributes</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#444444\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica Neue\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Intelligence 2, Strength 2, Presence 4</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#444444\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica Neue\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Wits 2, Dexterity 3, Manipulation 2</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#444444\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica Neue\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Resolve 2, Stamina 2, Composure 2</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#444444\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica Neue\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Skills </span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#444444\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica Neue\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Investigation 1, Medicine 3</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#444444\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica Neue\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Athletics 2, Brawl (Heabutt) 2, Drive 1, Firearms 1, Survival 1</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#444444\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica Neue\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Animal Ken (Bulls) 1, Empathy (Soothing Others) 1, Expression (Singing) 1, Intimidation 2, Persuasion 2, Socialize (Informal Parties) 3, Subterfuge 1</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#444444\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica Neue\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Merits</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#444444\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica Neue\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Fleet of Foot 3</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#444444\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica Neue\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Barfly 2</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#444444\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica Neue\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Inspiring 3</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#444444\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica Neue\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Striking Looks 2</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#444444\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica Neue\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Contracts</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#444444\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica Neue\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Contract of the Hearth 3</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#444444\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica Neue\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Contract of the Illuminating Summer 2</span></span></span><div style=\"margin-left:40px\">Note: When using Contract of the Illuminating Summer the Mask drops and all can see the Changeling\u2019s true self<br /> She may heal living beings for Glamour, including herself. One lethal/two bashing for a point of Glamour as an instant action</div><span style=\"color:#444444\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica Neue\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Note: Contract of the Illuminating Summer is homebrewed, and not even fully, it contains those two capabilities (healing/blinding) and it happened because I needed a changeling with such powers, and I didn\u2019t want to take two much other powers. It might be expanded into a full contract in the future</span></span></span><br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B5_EJSgV1u4SOFFJc3M5VmFDWVk?resourcekey=0-GEErNnDbGqlKYgoiuGausw&amp;usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My Bloodline conversions</a><br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1IbeKfqhWuG8jPN9vpGmDo0VY9n9-4ejxvRzfJRoir4k/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My House rules</a>","edited":{"userid":294,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/294-griautis","user":"Griautis","date":". 01-19-2016, 12:04 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/294-griautis","name":"Griautis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar294_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-20T02:22:49-08:00","id":812463,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Griautis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/811660-npc-lionela-ballard-the-kind-beast#post811660\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Note: Contract of the Illuminating Summer is homebrewed, and not even fully, it contains those two capabilities (healing/blinding) and it happened because I needed a changeling with such powers, and I didn\u2019t want to take two much other powers. It might be expanded into a full contract in the future</div> </div> </div> </div>Care to share here? Or is it found somewhere in your House Rules?<br />","signature":